            </note>
            <note corresp="#d94-f2" n="2" xml:id="d94-f2-content">
                <p>The records of the task force that oversaw the operation in Chile, commonly
                    referred to as “Track II”, are in Central Intelligence Agency, Job 80–00012A.
                    Records from this collection were made available to Department of State
                    historians for review, but copies were not provided for inclusion in this
                    volume.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d94-f3" n="3" xml:id="d94-f3-content">
